!Name: p90backlwss-2
!C A c/3 period 90 backward LWSS rake.
!C This uses a period 90 forward rake, a forward glider to backward LWSS
!C (and loaf) converter convoy, and a period 45 backward rake to delete
!C the unwanted loafs.
!C David I. Bell, December 2001
!Source: jslife-moving
